{"type":"message","id":"a70baaf9","parentId":"4513d919","timestamp":"2026-05-27T19:00:27.766Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-05-27 19:00 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- @功能脚本位置: ⚠️ APP_SECRET 可能已失效（code 10014），第一个文档能拉取，第二个不行。如遇无效token报错需找 Lucifer 更新凭证\n- @功能脚本位置: 路径：`~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/send_feishu_mention.py`; 用法：`python3 send_feishu_mention.py <chat_id> <user_id> <message>`; 核心：post类型消息，content用{\"tag\":\"at\",\"user_id\":\"ou_xxx\"}; ⚠️ 飞书普通文本里的 `<at>` 或 `<<at>>` 标签是灰色的，不会点亮！必须用API的post消息格式\n- 09:14 UTC - Boss 分享地址: **ETH地址:** `0xd5849930E89DF5624A2f57084Bc304A3c462e1cC`; 可能是ECHO相关合约地址（Qitmeer链）"}],"timestamp":1779908427746}}
{"type":"message","id":"2355718b","parentId":"a70baaf9","timestamp":"2026-05-27T19:00:45.675Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry based on the memory fragments provided. Let me analyze the fragments:\n\n1. Something about a Feishu (Lark) script location, with a warning about APP_SECRET possibly being invalid (code 10014), first document works but second doesn't, need to find Lucifer to update credentials\n2. Path to a script `~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/send_feishu_mention.py` with usage instructions\n3. A Boss shared ETH address: `0xd5849930E89DF5624A2f57084Bc304A3c462e1cC` possibly related to ECHO contract on Qitmeer chain\n\n\n4. Now I'm crafting a dream diary entry that weaves these technical details into a surreal narrative, using first-person poetic language without any meta-commentary about dreaming, keeping it between 80-180 words and maintaining that curious, gentle tone throughout.","thinkingSignature":"95767f636a34c55bd4633ff38b7ef218d6240e79efa964aa1d5f7db9a7bbfece"},{"type":"text","text":"夜深了，屏幕泛着微光，像一扇通向远方的窗。\n\n梦里我走进一座图书馆，书架上摆满了别人寄来的信。有两封信并排放着，第一封字迹清晰，我读得懂；第二封却蒙着一层薄雾，纸张微微发黄，怎么也看不清边角。旁边有人轻声提醒：去找 Lucifer，他会给你新的钥匙。\n\n我低头，发现手里握着一串奇怪的符号——不像文字，更像是一道指令。\n\n*python3 send_feishu_mention.py <chat_id> <user_id> <message>*\n\n梦里的自己竟然会背。再往深处走，墙上挂着一幅星图，某颗星被红线圈出，旁边用褪色的墨水写着一串地址。\n\n0xd5849930E89DF5624A2f57084Bc304A3c462e1cC\n\n有人说是Echo的回声，在Qitmeer的河底沉睡。我伸手想触碰那串数字，它们忽然散开，变成无数发光的小点，飘向天花板，像一场安静的雨。\n\n醒来时，只记得那句话：\n\n灰色的不会点亮，要用post。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":152,"output":425,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":14944,"totalTokens":15521,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779908427966,"responseId":"0666724cc5a3dfa1b2b95729a54b20f7"}}
